Third-party code incorporated into KernelIntrinsics.jl
======================================================

GemmKernels.jl
--------------
The MMA fallback (`src/mma.jl`) and the CUDA WMMA façade (`ext/CUDA/mma.jl`) are
derived from GemmKernels.jl (the `Operator` module — `GeneralFPUOp` and `WMMAOp`),
adapted for cross-architecture portability (backend-neutral lane/warpsize, a
parametrizable accumulation operator, and the KernelIntrinsics submodule API).

  Upstream:  https://github.com/JuliaGPU/GemmKernels.jl
  Reference: T. Faingnaert, T. Besard, B. De Sutter, "Flexible Performant GEMM
             Kernels on GPUs", IEEE Transactions on Parallel and Distributed
             Systems, 33(9):2230-2248, 2022. doi:10.1109/TPDS.2021.3136457

